rdi.id().getTmuFinished()
Checks if TMU measurements have been finished or timeout.
When you use getTmuFinished() to check measurement results, it checks all sites to
see whether measurements on all sites are done or measurements on any site is
timeout. If the measurements on all sites have been done, this API returns TRUE. If the
measurements on any site is timeout, this API returns FALSE.
getTmuFinished() is designed for a burst, not for a measurement. This means when it
is used with a result ID, the ID is a burst ID, not the measurement ID.
